            <div><strong class="text-slate-900">How Smart Brands Solve It:</strong> Source the core product from a verified Futian factory stall, and pair it with packaging from <strong class="text-slate-900">Chouzhou North Packaging Street (#13)</strong> or District 3 printing booths—giving you retail-ready private label goods without massive factory MOQs.</div>
