            <div><strong class="text-slate-900">Bulk Wholesale Orders:</strong> Standard practice is a small upfront deposit (<strong class="text-slate-900">10%–30%</strong> or <strong class="text-slate-900">$150–$300</strong> per booth to lock production) via T/T bank transfer, with the remaining balance paid only after pre-shipment quality inspection.</div>
