            <div><strong class="text-slate-900">Warning on Blind Forwarder Loading:</strong> Never let stalls drop uninspected cartons at a freight forwarder warehouse without verification. Always run a pre-shipment check or check our <a href="/sourcing-guide" class="text-blue-600 font-bold underline">China Sourcing & Shipping Playbook &rarr;</a></div>
